5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I worry about who is actually standing in the room. The staff list has changed so much.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shion,,We keep apologising at the door. I need to know where past seasons actually broke down.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,The shows we were proudest of on paper are not the ones people came back for.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,The main room has to work as a building. I need to know what the floor can absorb.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Sakura,,The money always seems to vanish into the walls. I want to see where it goes.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Sakura, that is a fair point. The human element is often overlooked in the budget.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Misaki, if the floor fails, the show fails. I am checking the delivery logs too.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"@Shizue, exactly. I want to see the comment slips to understand what visitors actually value.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Shion, yes. I am looking at the structural survey for the suspended bay.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Sakura,,I will check the loan transport costs. They seem to eat up the budget.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I will look at the conservation lab staffing. We need to know who is available.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shion,,I will also check the lender paperwork against shipping cut-offs. Delays are my enemy.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,May,,I will review the weekend head counts. Data beats intuition on what draws crowds.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I will check the maintenance log for powered displays. They are risky for the space.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Sakura,,I will also look at the mount-making charges. Bespoke work is expensive.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Shizue,,Let us see what the records say.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Shion,,Agreed. The numbers will guide us.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,May,,I hope the data is clear.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Misaki,,We need to avoid the usual traps.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Sakura,,We will see.,"{""words"":3,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
