35,2,1,talk,Shizue,,The conservation lab is down to one person. The backlog is two hundred pieces.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shion,,Two of the last four openings slipped because paperwork arrived after the cut-off.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,May,,Head counts climb where mechanisms run. Comment slips say people come back for the staff.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Misaki,,The suspended bay is capped at four hundred kilos. Powered displays had seventeen call-outs.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Sakura,,Loan transport is a third of installation costs. Mount-making rates have risen by half.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Sakura, if loans are so expensive, we should rely on our own holdings.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Misaki, if the bay is weak, we cannot hang heavy things. That limits our options.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,May,,"@Shizue, so live demonstrations are key? The data says presence matters more than objects.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Shion, yes. Heavy stonework needed shoring last time. It is a major risk.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@May, that aligns with the costs. If we avoid loans, we save on transport and insurance.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Shizue,,The volunteer roster is mostly the town history circle. They are busy with walks.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shion,,The shipping delays are a recurring theme. We need reliable partners or local items.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,May,,"The comment slips are consistent. People want to see someone working, not just looking.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Misaki,,The maintenance log is worrying. Four call-outs happened during opening hours.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Sakura,,The joiner's rate is up. Anything bespoke is a budget killer.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Shizue,,We must weigh the staffing against the facility risks.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shion,,Avoid the projects that depend on distant loans.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,May,,The data points to engagement over static display.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Misaki,,The structural limits are hard constraints.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Sakura,,The costs favor local or self-contained exhibits.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
