60,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"Candidate A, Textiles, uses local craftspeople. That fits the staffing need.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Shion,,"Candidate D, Maritime, relies on partner loans. That is the delay risk I found.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,May,,Candidate A has demonstrations. That matches the comment slip data perfectly.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Misaki,,"Candidate C, Light and Motion, needs overhead rigging. The bay is capped.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Sakura,,"Candidate D has high loan costs. Candidate A uses local items, saving on mounts.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"@May, yes. The town history circle could help with A, but they are busy.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Shion,,"@Sakura, correct. D is a no-go for me. The paperwork slips are too common.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,May,,"@Misaki, if C needs heavy rigging, it is risky. A is lighter and interactive.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Shion, D also has heavy models. The structural survey worries me there too.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
