70,3,3,talk,Shizue,,"Candidate B, City Under Excavation, has a conservation bench. But the lab is empty.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Shion,,B uses local finds. No distant loans. That is safer for delivery.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,May,,"B has a visible bench. That is ""presence,"" but the lab is understaffed.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Misaki,,B is static mostly. C is too heavy. D is too risky. A is interactive.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Sakura,,B requires conservation work. The backlog is two hundred pieces. We can't do it.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Shizue,,A seems the most stable. The craftspeople are local and available.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Shion,,It avoids the shipping delays. I can live with that.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,May,,"The data supports A. People come back for the people, not the objects.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Misaki,,It is light enough for the bay. No heavy rigging needed.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Sakura,,The costs are manageable. No expensive loans or bespoke mounts.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
